{"text":"kuruntokai","n":369,"lines":["அத்த வாகை அமலை வானெற்","றரியார் சிலம்பி னரிசி யார்ப்பக்","கோடை தூக்குங் கானம்","செல்வாந் தோழி நல்கினர் நமரே"],"tr":["atta vākai amalai vāṉeṟ","ṟariyār cilampi ṉarici yārppak","kōṭai tūkkuṅ kāṉam","celvān tōḻi nalkiṉar namarē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"குடவாயிற் கீரத்தனார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Kuṭavāyiṟ Kīrattaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 4"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அத்த","tr":"atta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அத்","tr":"at"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"வாகை","tr":"vākai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]},{"text":"அமலை","tr":"amalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அம","tr":"ama"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"வானெற்","tr":"vāṉeṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னெற்","tr":"ṉeṟ"}]}],[{"text":"றரியார்","tr":"ṟariyār","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றரி","tr":"ṟari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யார்","tr":"yār"}]},{"text":"சிலம்பி","tr":"cilampi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிலம்","tr":"cilam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பி","tr":"pi"}]},{"text":"னரிசி","tr":"ṉarici","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"னரி","tr":"ṉari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சி","tr":"ci"}]},{"text":"யார்ப்பக்","tr":"yārppak","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யார்ப்","tr":"yārp"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பக்","tr":"pak"}]}],[{"text":"கோடை","tr":"kōṭai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"}]},{"text":"தூக்குங்","tr":"tūkkuṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூக்","tr":"tūk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குங்","tr":"kuṅ"}]},{"text":"கானம்","tr":"kāṉam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னம்","tr":"ṉam"}]}],[{"text":"செல்வாந்","tr":"celvān","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செல்","tr":"cel"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாந்","tr":"vān"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"நல்கினர்","tr":"nalkiṉar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கினர்","tr":"kiṉar"}]},{"text":"நமரே","tr":"namarē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நம","tr":"nama"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அத்த","parts":[{"text":"அத்த","lemma":"அத்தம்","gloss":"desert path"}],"gloss":"of the desert path"},{"surface":"வாகை","parts":[{"text":"வாகை","lemma":"வாகை","gloss":"vākai tree"}],"gloss":"vākai tree"},{"surface":"அமலை","parts":[{"text":"அமலை","lemma":"அமலை","gloss":"dense cluster"}],"gloss":"dense cluster"},{"surface":"வான்","parts":[{"text":"வான்","lemma":"வான்","gloss":"white/dry"}],"gloss":"white/dry"},{"surface":"நெற்","parts":[{"text":"நெற்","lemma":"நெற்று","gloss":"dry pod"}],"gloss":"dry pod"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"றரியார்","parts":[{"text":"றரியார்","lemma":"அரியார்","gloss":"having pebbles"}],"gloss":"having pebbles"},{"surface":"சிலம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"சிலம்பு","lemma":"சிலம்பு","gloss":"anklet"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like/of"}],"gloss":"like an anklet"},{"surface":"அரிசி","parts":[{"text":"அரிசி","lemma":"அரிசி","gloss":"grains"}],"gloss":"grains"},{"surface":"ஆர்ப்பக்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்ப்ப","lemma":"ஆர்த்தல்","gloss":"to sound"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"increment"}],"gloss":"to sound"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கோடை","parts":[{"text":"கோடை","lemma":"கோடை","gloss":"west wind"}],"gloss":"west wind"},{"surface":"தூக்குங்","parts":[{"text":"தூக்குங்","lemma":"தூக்குங்","gloss":"shaking"}],"gloss":"shaking","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"கானம்","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செல்வாந்","parts":[{"text":"செல்வாந்","lemma":"செல்வாந்","gloss":"we will go"}],"gloss":"we will go","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"நல்கினர்","parts":[{"text":"நல்கினர்","lemma":"நல்குதல்","gloss":"bestowed grace"}],"gloss":"he bestowed grace"},{"surface":"நமரே","parts":[{"text":"நமர்","lemma":"நமர்","gloss":"our lover"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"our lover indeed"}]}],"literal":"Of the desert path, the vākai tree's dense clusters of white dry pods, / like the pebbles of a sounding anklet, their grains making sound, / as the west wind shakes them in the forest, / we shall go, my friend, our lover has bestowed grace on us.","translation":"My friend, our lover has shown us his grace. We shall now go through the forest where the west wind shakes the dense clusters of white, dry pods of the vākai trees on the desert path, making their seeds rattle like the pebbles inside a sounding anklet.","modern":"தோழியே! நம் தலைவர் நமக்கு அருள் புரிந்துள்ளார். பாலைவனப் பாதையில் உள்ள வாகை மரத்தின் அடர்ந்த வெண்மையான உலர்ந்த நெற்றுகள், உள்ளே இருக்கும் விதைகள் ஒலிக்கும் சிலம்பின் பரல் போல ஒலிக்குமாறு, கோடைக்காற்று அசைக்கும் காட்டின் வழியே நாம் செல்வோம்.","explanation":"The speaker is the companion (thozhi) addressing the heroine (thalaivi). The hero, who had left to earn wealth through the difficult desert paths (pālai), has returned, having accomplished his task and bestowed his grace upon them. The companion joyfully tells the heroine that they will now travel together through the forest. She describes the desert landscape where the dry, white pods of the vākai tree are shaken by the hot west wind (kōdai), making a rattling sound like the pebbles inside a dancer's anklet. This vivid auditory image of the dry pods rattling in the wind beautifully contrasts the harshness of the desert with the joy of the hero's return, marking the transition from separation to union.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.45],[1.45,2.5],[2.5,2.89],[2.89,3.3],[3.35,3.7],[3.7,4.6],[4.6,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.8],[6.8,6.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.55],[1.55,2.0],[2.0,2.7],[2.7,3.3],[3.36,3.8],[3.8,4.6],[4.6,5.1],[5.1,5.5],[5.5,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,7.4],[7.4,7.5]]},"sync":[[["அத்த","of the desert path"]],[["வாகை","vākai tree"]],[["அமலை","dense cluster"]],[["வான்","white/dry"],["நெற்","dry pod"]],[["றரியார்","having pebbles"]],[["சிலம்பின்","like an anklet"]],[["சிலம்பின்","like an anklet"],["அரிசி","grains"]],[["ஆர்ப்பக்","to sound"]],[["கோடை","west wind"]],[["தூக்குங்","shaking"]],[["கானம்","forest"]],[["செல்வாந்","we will go"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["நல்கினர்","he bestowed grace"]],[["நமரே","our lover indeed"]]]}